    "### BREAKING CHANGES\r",
    "\r",
    "* **lodash:** no longer do we allow paths like `attribute[5].something`, or other indexed forms, only `.` is allowed as special key.\r",
    "\r",
    "All existing tests still pass, and we never documented you could use `lodash.get` patterns other than `.`.\r",
    "\r",
    "* feat(get): accept array & bracked-separated string\r",
    "\r",
    "moved to utils at the same time\r",
